          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 134830,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A volte vogliamo formattare i paragrafi con interruzioni di riga.</p><p>Per esempio, questa canzone apparirebbe molto meglio se <code>Raindrops on roses</code> comparisse su una riga, <code>Whiskers on kittens</code> su quella successiva e così via.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;h1&gt;My favorite things&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt; Raindrops on roses Whiskers on kittens Bright copper kettles Warm&#xA; woolen mittens &lt;/p&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Line breaks",
            "id": 134837,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo separare le righe con l'aiuto del <strong>tag di interruzione di riga</strong>: <code>br</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Raindrops on roses\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Whiskers on kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Bright copper kettles \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Warm woolen mittens\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"106\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo separare le righe con l'aiuto del <strong>tag di interruzione di riga</strong>: <code>br</code>. Sta da solo, quindi non ha un tag di chiusura.</p><p>Fai apparire ogni cosa preferita su una riga distinta all'interno del paragrafo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Raindrops on roses\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Whiskers on kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Bright copper kettles\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Warm woolen mittens\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;p&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/p&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> e infine <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
