          {
            "title": "Empty tags",
            "id": 134831,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>&lt;br&gt;</code> è un <strong>tag vuoto</strong>. I tag vuoti non hanno un tag di chiusura né contenuto. Sono anche chiamati tag autochiudenti.</p><p>Metti insieme il tag di interruzione di riga.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Raindrops on roses\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Whiskers on kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Bright copper kettles\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Warm woolen mittens\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"107\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Emphasis",
            "id": 134812,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Esiste un elemento per dare enfasi al testo. Lo rende <em>corsivo</em>. Si chiama elemento <code>em</code>. Aggiungi <code>&lt;em&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Raindrops on \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"roses\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Whiskers on kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Bright copper kettles\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Warm woolen mittens\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"60\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;em&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Esiste un elemento per dare enfasi al testo. Lo rende corsivo. Si chiama elemento <code>em</code>.</p><p>Racchiudi la parola giusta in modo da enfatizzare solo roses.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Raindrops on \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"roses\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Whiskers on kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Bright copper kettles\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Warm woolen mittens\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;strong&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/strong&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;br&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;em&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Importance",
            "id": 134813,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per definire il testo come importante, usiamo i tag <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>. Rendono il testo <strong>in grassetto</strong>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Raindrops on \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"roses\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Whiskers on \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"102\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per definire il testo come importante, usiamo i tag <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>. Rendono il testo in grassetto.</p><p>Ora definisci come importante solo kittens e non modificare roses.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Raindrops on \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"roses\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Whiskers on \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;em&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/em&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;br&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 134838,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A cosa serve il tag <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\">Dà enfasi al testo</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\">Aggiunge un'interruzione di riga</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aggiunge un'interruzione di riga.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inserisci <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> tra due parole in un paragrafo. Qual è l'effetto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La seconda parola passa su una nuova riga</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Entrambe le parole diventano corsive</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Le due parole vengono divise in paragrafi distinti</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La seconda parola passa su una nuova riga.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 134814,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale di questi tag è un tag vuoto o autochiudente?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;br&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;/em&gt;</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;p&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un tag vuoto non ha un tag di chiusura né contenuto. Quale di questi è un tag vuoto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;br&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;p&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;button&gt;</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;h1&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 134839,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quali di questi tag danno enfasi al testo?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;em&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;p&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/p&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&lt;em&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'elemento <code>em</code> dà enfasi al testo e lo rende corsivo.</p><p>Racchiudi una parola di una frase tra <code>&lt;em&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>. Cosa cambia?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Solo la parola racchiusa diventa corsiva.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">L'intera frase diventa corsiva.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">La parola racchiusa inizia su una nuova riga.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Solo la parola racchiusa diventa corsiva.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 134815,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A cosa servono i tag <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Definiscono il testo come importante</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Rendono il testo inseparabile da un'interruzione di riga</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Definiscono il testo come importante.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'elemento <code>strong</code> contrassegna il testo come importante e lo rende grassetto.</p><p>Scrivi <code>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warning&lt;/strong&gt;: wet floor.&lt;/p&gt;</code>.</p><p>Quale testo è contrassegnato come importante e appare in grassetto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Warning</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Warning: wet floor.</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>: wet floor.</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>Warning</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 134816,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dai enfasi al titolo dell'album aggiungendo i tag di enfasi di apertura e chiusura.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" I just listened to \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Abbey Road\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" for the first time.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;em&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa tag corrispondenti per dare enfasi solo al titolo dell'album affinché venga visualizzato in corsivo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" I just listened to \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Abbey Road\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" for the first time.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;strong&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/strong&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;br&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;em&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
